cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Nour OSeMOSYS Studio: a desktop studio to build, solve and analyse OSeMOSYS models"
version: "0.22.1"
date-released: "2026-11-11"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24117127"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Islam-Dj/Nour-OSeMOSYS-Studio-Standard"
license: Apache-2.0
authors:
  - family-names: "DJEDAA"
    given-names: "Nour Elislam"
    affiliation: "Centre de Recherche en Économie Appliquée pour le Développement (CREAD), Algiers, Algeria"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0004-5488-8401"
abstract: >-
  Nour OSeMOSYS Studio builds, checks, solves and analyses OSeMOSYS models with the standard OSeMOSYS model. Models
  are built on the diagram of the system or with forms, or read from OSeMOSYS / MUIO data files; MUIO cases are imported
  and exported. It solves with HiGHS, GLPK, CBC or Gurobi (when installed and licensed), shows every result with its
  meaning and unit, answers questions about the results written in English, French, Spanish or Arabic without AI, and
  offers Monte Carlo and robust decision making.
keywords:
  - OSeMOSYS
  - MUIO
  - energy planning
  - CLEWs
  - Monte Carlo
  - robust decision making
  - HiGHS
